{"articleNo":"190811","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=190811&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2018 DPU Admission Call for Graduate School Studying at DPU, China","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2018.03.29","hit":"4041","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">중국 대련공업대학교에서 중국 정부 초청 장학생을 아래와 같이 모집하오니, 관심있는 학생들의 지원 바랍니다. </span></font></span></b></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span></font></span></b>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><font color=\"#000000\">2018<span class=\"apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span></font><span style=\"COLOR: blue\">DPU Admission Call</span><span class=\"apple-converted-space\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;</font></span><font color=\"#000000\">for Graduate School Studying at DPU, China</font></span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\"><!--?xml:namespace prefix = \"o\" ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">We are pleased to inform you of 2018 CGS (Chinese Government Scholarships) Guideline for Master’s and Doctoral candidates here in China.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">As the one of the CGS recipient universities in China, we will be able to nominate candidates.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">This might be a great opportunity for your students to be able to study in China with a full government scholarship.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><font color=\"#000000\">Please see attached for further information and if there are any candidates interested in this program, please send me<span class=\"apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span></font><b><u><span style=\"COLOR: red\">one original application document package no later than April 20th 2018.</span></u></b></span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><font color=\"#000000\">All applications must complete the application procedures online (</font></span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><a href=\"http://studyinchina.csc.edu.cn/#/register\"><u><font color=\"#0000ff\" size=\"3\" face=\"굴림\">http://studyinchina.csc.edu.cn/#/register</font></u></a></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><font color=\"#000000\">)</font><b><u><span style=\"COLOR: red\"> no later than April 15th 2018</span></u></b><font color=\"#000000\">. Original application documents must be delivered to my office by the deadline.</font></span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">&nbsp;<b>Chinese Government Scholarship Programs</b></span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 27.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-INDENT: -27.5pt; background-size: initial; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-fareast-font-family: ？宋; mso-hansi-font-family: ？宋\">1. Chinese University Programs:</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 36.75pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-INDENT: -21pt; background-size: initial; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; background-origin: initial;