family: ？宋; mso-hansi-font-family: ？宋\">It only supports doctoral students of Food Science and Engineering. </span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 31.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-INDENT: -21pt; background-size: initial; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Wingdings; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings\">l</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 7pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings\">&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-fareast-font-family: ？宋\">&nbsp;Silk Road Program (Open)</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 31.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; background-size: initial; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-fareast-font-family: ？宋\">It supports full-time master’s students and doctoral students. </span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; background-size: initial; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial\"><font face=\"굴림\"><font color=\"#000000\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; background-size: initial; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial\"><font face=\"굴림\"><font color=\"#000000\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">Eligibility: </span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 27.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-INDENT: -27.5pt; background-size: initial; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-fareast-font-family: ？宋\">1. Applicants must be a citizen of a country other than the People’s Republic of China, and be in goodhealth.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 16.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-INDENT: -16.5pt; background-size: initial; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-fareast-font-family: ？宋; mso-hansi-font-family: ？宋\">2. Students who are now studying in China or already winners of Chinese Government Scholarship are not allowed to apply.Students who graduated from any Chinese university or college need at least one year of departure to apply. </span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 11.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-INDENT: -11pt; background-size: initial; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-fareast-font-family: ？宋; mso-hansi-font-family: ？宋\">3. Candidates must be a Master Degree holder when applying for the doctoral programs. Candidates must be a Bachelor Degree holder when applying for the master programs. </span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 11.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-INDENT: -11pt; background-size: initial; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-fareast-font-family: ？宋; mso-hansi-font-family: ？宋\">4. For applicants of English-taught programs, there are no Chinese language requirements. For applicants of Chinese-taught programs, good Chinese language proficiency, able to follow Chinese-taught courses well, is required. Applicants without any Chinese language study experience must take one year Language Preparation Class. </span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; background-size: initial; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-fareast-font-family: ？宋; mso-hansi-font-family: ？宋\">5. Applicants must apply for programs related to previous major study in order to be able to follow major courses well.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></p><p class=\"xmsonormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;